{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">洪永城與妻子梁諾妍日前趁暑假空檔，帶著一對女兒「Sir Face」Amber與「Sir Nose」Beryl飛往日本展開溫馨親子遊。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">雖然旅程以照顧女兒為主，但梁諾妍亦把握時間瘋狂大掃貨，買了整行李箱的衣服給女兒，甚至連家中愛寵「Molly豬」都有零食收穫。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c91feb11-2eb4-4afc-b1ab-a9e2753aa08e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026WRjj4h90ul1784712001.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c91feb11-2eb4-4afc-b1ab-a9e2753aa08e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">行程緊湊且充滿新鮮感，兩人為女兒規劃了多項親近大自然的活動，包括去水族館看海洋生物、到迷你豬餐廳近距離親親小豬、體驗親手餵雞仔及到動物園餵羊仔。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"68276952-3af2-427b-9ffe-967ed9bf42ab.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026M0gXJuei6c1784712008.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"68276952-3af2-427b-9ffe-967ed9bf42ab.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">膽大又有愛心的Amber與Beryl面對小動物毫不畏懼，全程表現雀躍並展現燦爛笑容。除了親子動物互動，一家人更體驗了公共浴場浸浴以及踩單車漫遊，過程寫意溫馨。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T04:19:39.356680+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}